wawoff2 2.0.1 (https://github.com/fontello/wawoff2): Google's woff2 encoder and decoder (https://github.com/google/woff2,
with Brotli, both MIT) built to WebAssembly with Emscripten, the wasm inlined. build/compress_binding.js and
build/decompress_binding.js as published on npm, unchanged. Slop Font (fontcreator/) runs each in its own worker
(fontcreator/js/io/woff2-worker.js), so their Emscripten 'Module' globals never meet.

